    "name": "projected bias-aware interval",
    "construction": "\\(I^\\star=[\\Pi_M(\\widehat\\tau(v^\\star))-\\Psi_{\\alpha,\\Gamma}(v^\\star),\\Pi_M(\\widehat\\tau(v^\\star))+\\Psi_{\\alpha,\\Gamma}(v^\\star)]\\cap[-2M,2M]\\) when \\(\\Psi_{\\alpha,\\Gamma}(v^\\star)<2M\\), and \\(I^\\star=[-2M,2M]\\) otherwise, where \\(\\Pi_M(x)=\\min\\{2M,\\max\\{-2M,x\\}\\}\\)",
